# Initial Setup's Camera Gimbal page, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigMount.cs.
#
# The claim: the page object's constructor fills the four output boxes with the channel names,
# the RC ones removed on a vehicle with SERVO1_MIN (ConfigMount.cs:21-102), and binds MNT_TYPE;
# Activate needs CAM_TRIGG_TYPE and, without it, disables the page and writes nothing (:104-112).
#
# What SITL cannot exercise: every write. SITL's copter is 4.5, whose camera is CAM1_TYPE and
# whose mount is MNT1_TYPE: it has no CAM_TRIGG_TYPE, so the page is disabled - as Mission Planner
# disables it against this firmware - and no MNT_TYPE, so the type combo is disabled too. The
# output assignment, its ensureDisabled clearing, MNT_MODE, the shutter's relay and transistor,
# the angle limits and Activate's writes are covered, against a 4.2 copter's parameters, by the
# unit tests in crates/mp-gui/src/config/mount.rs. The script proves the page shows, disabled,
# with the lists the constructor builds, and that clicking it writes nothing.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-mount.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen params
window 1600x1200
settle 6

click param-download
settle 15
expect params.held > 1000
expect params.value.MNT1_TYPE 0
expect params.value.CAM1_TYPE 0

click tab-setup
expect config.mount.active false
click setup-page-ConfigOptional
click setup-page-ConfigMount
settle 1
expect setup.page ConfigMount
expect config.mount.active true

# No CAM_TRIGG_TYPE: the page is disabled.
expect config.mount.enabled false
expect config.mount.MNT_TYPE.enabled false
expect config.mount.note NOTE: the gimbal type takes effect on the next reboot of the fight controller
expect config.mount.trigger Please set the Ch7 Option to Camera Trigger

# The constructor's lists: SERVO1_MIN is listed, so the RC names are removed - Disable and
# fourteen outputs, and for the shutter the relay and transistor besides.
expect config.mount.tilt.options 15
expect config.mount.roll.options 15
expect config.mount.pan.options 15
expect config.mount.shutter.options 17
expect config.mount.tilt none
expect config.mount.TSM.enabled false

# A disabled page takes no clicks: nothing is written.
click mount-tilt
click mount-TR
click mount-TSM-up
settle 2
expect config.mount.write none
expect config.mount.writes.pending 0
expect config.mount.message none

click setup-page-ConfigOptional
settle 1
expect config.mount.active false
